  "mainStatRankWeighting": {
    "_comment": "Main-stat rank weighting: safeguard score bonus = weight * factor * (max16[clamp(rank,4,6)][slot][variant] / max16[6][slot][variant]). Level-independent (uses the rank's +16 main-stat, not current level), so a leveled and an unleveled piece of the same rank score the same main-stat term. Values are in-game level-16 main-stat maxima validated against all sample RSL DBs; rarity does NOT affect main-stat maxima. Banner has higher flat HP/ATK/DEF caps and amulet CDMG is half the gauntlet cap, hence the per-slot table. 'factor' is a per-rule user-tunable multiplier (defaultFactor/min/max/step below) letting the main-stat term compete with weighted substats; absent = defaultFactor for backward compatibility.",
